    - rid: 4707331682537308452
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'DESCENT end screen button: begin a new descent from level -1 (560 x 86, 40 pt)'
    - rid: 4707331682537308453
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: DESCENT end screen slip heading (34 pt amber, letter-spaced, one line, 1500 px). The ## and # are literal redactions, keep them
    - rid: 4707331682537308454
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: DESCENT end screen headline (84 pt red, one line, 1500 px, auto-size). {n} = the level the player died on, shown as -n
    - rid: 4707331682537308455
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: DESCENT end screen stats line (36 pt, one line, 1500 px). {stars} = stars taken over the whole descent, {time} = m:ss total run time
    - rid: 4707331682537308456
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: DESCENT end screen cause line (36 pt, one line). {cause} = one of the ui.descent.cause.* words
    - rid: 4707331682537308457
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'DESCENT cause word: the hunter caught you. Ends the sentence ''CAUSE: ...'' (a single word or short phrase, all caps)'
    - rid: 4707331682537308458
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'DESCENT cause word: the looping corridor''s visitor caught you'
    - rid: 4707331682537308459
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'DESCENT cause word: the escape timer ran out'
    - rid: 4707331682537308460
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'DESCENT cause word: another entity took you'
    - rid: 4707331682537308461
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "DESCENT end screen line, shown only if the hunter learned a habit (32 pt, one line, 1500 px). {habits} = e.g. LOCKERS \u25AE\u25AE\u25AF \xB7 DARK \u25AE\u25AF\u25AF"
    - rid: 4707331682537308462
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Habit name inside the IT HAD LEARNED line: you hid in lockers (one word, all caps)'
    - rid: 4707331682537308463
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Habit name inside the IT HAD LEARNED line: you threw things (one word, all caps)'
    - rid: 4707331682537308464
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Habit name inside the IT HAD LEARNED line: you moved without the torch (one word, all caps)'
    - rid: 4707331682537308465
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Habit name inside the IT HAD LEARNED line: you ran (one word, all caps)'
    - rid: 4707331682537308466
