      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Controls sheet for keyboard / mouse and gamepad (34 pt, three lines, 1400 px, auto-size). Every {placeholder} is replaced by the bound key or button in bold (do not translate or remove them, you may reorder): move, sprint, look, torch, focus, interact, throw, item1, item2, map, pause'
